Now we need to have transport leg assembled, linked, loading authorized.

We need to assemble transport leg: action assemble_transport_leg (or assemble_origin_loaded_leg etc). The simplest is assemble_transport_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available). After we have origin and destination availability locked and confirmed, nodes ready, we can assemble.

